%% source-of-truth-for: the N=1 path of one card, ask to deploy (mycroft#674). Steps marked (inferred) are not stated in mycroft#674 or the anansi-agent handoff.
flowchart TD
  ask["Justin asks (ask or /unblock round)"] --> cos["◆MYCROFT_COS plans: files the card, ranks it"]
  cos --> route["●ANANSI_ROUTER routes: anansi route handoff"]
  route --> kal["■KALADIN builder launches: one lane, one worktree"]
  kal --> build["Builder works the issue, tests green"]
  build --> pr["PR ready, assigned to Justin, body says Closes #N"]
  pr --> verify["(inferred) ●ANANSI_ROUTER verifies the PR"]
  verify --> tomb["Builder tombstones its session (anansi-agent#133)"]
  verify --> merge["Justin merges"]
  merge --> deploy["Deploy: sitedep.sh or qwen-refresh.sh (inferred: Justin's call)"]
  classDef inferred stroke-dasharray: 4 3
  class verify,deploy inferred
